sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Checkout
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant R as Polling relay
    participant K as Kafka
    participant C as Fulfillment
    rect rgb(233, 245, 241)
        Note over H,D: One database transaction
        H->>D: Insert order + outbox event
        D-->>H: Commit both rows
    end
    Note over H,D: Crash now: the event survives
    R->>D: Read unpublished events
    D-->>R: Stored event + stable UUID
    R->>K: Send OrderPlaced
    K-->>R: Acknowledge
    Note over D,K: Crash here: restart can send the same event again
    par Record publication
        R->>D: Set published_at in a new transaction
    and Process Kafka delivery independently
        K->>C: Deliver OrderPlaced (may repeat)
        C->>D: Insert fulfillment<br/>ON CONFLICT (event_id) DO NOTHING
    end
    Note over D,C: One fulfillment row per event UUID
